<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine money market trading suspended.</title>
<headline>Philippine money market trading suspended.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading on the interbank call loan market was suspended on Monday due to bad weather in the capital, bankers said.</p>
<p>Earlier, the Bankers Association of the Philippines (BAP) announced there would be no clearing of cheques in the Metro Manila area.</p>
<p>-- Manila newsroom (63 2) 841-8937</p>
</text>
